# Pinned at the last release this host can execute: every tree-sitter >= 0.26.0 binary
# is linked against GLIBC 2.39 and upstream publishes no musl asset, so 0.26.1, 0.26.13
# and 0.27.0 all abort with "GLIBC_2.39 not found" on Debian 12's glibc 2.36 (retested
